### Advance workflow to next step
PATCH {{host}}/api/workflows/123/next
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "type": "Scan",
  "data": {
    "lineId": "ABC-1",
    "qty": 1,
    "items": [
      {
        "productId": "PROD-001",
        "quantity": 5,
        "tags": ["urgent", "fragile"]
      },
      {
        "productId": "PROD-002",
        "quantity": 3,
        "tags": ["standard"]
      }
    ],
    "metadata": {
      "source": "warehouse",
      "priority": "high"
    }
  }
}
